  "description": "## What's New\n- **Calmer chat timeline** — finished tool steps fold into one `N actions completed` line, so long conversations stay readable\n- **Thinking is now live-only** — it shows while the tutor is actually working, then disappears instead of cluttering history\n- **Drill into any step** — expand the summary, then expand any row for its exact payload, memory diff or streamed JSON\n- **Smoother motion** — rows and cards grow and collapse instead of snapping\n\n## Fixes\n- Grammar cards and their chips now always size to their content, so no tall empty card on narrow screens\n- Chip rows wrap instead of clipping on small displays"
}
